     "id": "p2",
     "text": "A man who never aged came to collect four ships. Gus’s mother burned his contract in the cave, and the sea took Silas Crane."
    },
    {
     "id": "p3",
     "text": "But his shadow stayed behind, on the wall. Smiling.",
     "pause": 0.6
    }
